meta {
  name: deactivate package
  type: http
  seq: 26
}

delete {
  url: {{base_url}}/administrator/packages/:id/
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: 347cde65-90ad-4178-8816-332e19e04748
}

docs {
  ## API explanation
  Deactivates rather than deletes: sets `active` false. Purchases reference
  packages with `PROTECT`, so deleting one would orphan invoice history and is
  refused at the database level anyway.

  It disappears from the public pricing and from every picker; existing
  purchases and their remaining classes are untouched and can still be booked
  against.

  `PATCH {"active": true}` restores it.

  ## API example response
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Package deactivated."
  }
}
